WEBVTT

00:02:29.917 --> 00:02:31.250
I felt awful.

00:02:32.792 --> 00:02:36.268
Being confronted with death
can be difficult for everyone.

00:02:36.292 --> 00:02:39.833
Often we rely solely
on our instincts to help guide us.

00:02:40.458 --> 00:02:41.768
In law enforcement,

00:02:41.792 --> 00:02:43.851
we tend to put up an emotional shield,

00:02:43.875 --> 00:02:45.601
a barrier to emotions.

00:02:45.625 --> 00:02:48.184
That way we can focus
on policies and procedures

00:02:48.208 --> 00:02:49.458
to guide us.

00:02:50.125 --> 00:02:53.417
This is why we can sometimes
come across as robotic.

00:02:54.208 --> 00:02:56.726
I've discovered
that in the civilian world,

00:02:56.750 --> 00:03:00.018
you're often driven
by that instinct to fix it,